      "summary": "Delays and sequences drive events from IF and LSU through configurable-depth FIFO and delay chains",
      "subject": "event pipeline control",
      "explanation": "i_driveFrmIf passes through delay_6UIcache then cFifo2_If, followed by three delay stages (delay_IF1-3) to produce o_driveNextToIf. i_driveFrmLsu passes through cFifo2_Lsu then two delay stages (delay_LSU1-2) to produce o_driveNextToLsu. Free signals are directly connected to corresponding FIFO free inputs.",
